Optional PP-OCRv6 tiny general-text reader
----------------------------------------
The official tiny detector/recognizer weights and character dictionary are
published by PaddlePaddle under Apache-2.0. The weights are fetched, not stored
in this repository; pinned revisions and checksums are recorded in
scripts/ppocr-v6-models.json. The dictionary derives from the pinned official
recognizer configuration. Rust preprocessing/postprocessing follows the
PaddleX conventions documented in experiments/ppocr_v6/README.md; the public
model distribution includes scripts/ppocr-v6-NOTICE.txt and LICENSE-APACHE.

GS1 Barcode Syntax Dictionary (scripts/gs1/, generated demo/src/gs1/dictionary.ts)
  Copyright GS1 AISBL. https://github.com/gs1/gs1-syntax-dictionary
  Apache License 2.0; full licence in scripts/gs1/LICENSE.
  Pinned source revision and SHA-256 hashes in scripts/gs1/source.json.
  Changes: transformed dictionary records into offline TypeScript parsing metadata.
  The local parser implements bounded extraction and selected checks, not complete
  GS1 conformance, issuer verification, or GS1 product registration verification.
